<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's forint ends virtually unchanged.</title>
<headline>Hungary's forint ends virtually unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's forint closed virtually unchanged against the dollar on Wednesday, at 155.14/19.</p>
<p>The Hungarian unit closed on Tuesday at 155.17/22.</p>
<p>Dealers said the market had been relatively calm.</p>
<p>&quot;There was not much activity, as usual for the last couple of days,&quot; said Zoltan Szaloky of ABN-AMRO.</p>
<p>The forint was right on the National Bank of Hungary's bid of 155.14</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom ++ 36 1 327 4040.</p>
</text>
